		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  Problème de connexion]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=18605#p18605"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="codebox"><pre><code># TYPE  DATABASE        USER            ADDRESS                 METHOD

# IPv4 local connections:
host    all             all             127.0.0.1/32            md5
host    all             all             192.168.1.0/24            password

# IPv6 local connections:
host    all             all             ::1/128                 md5
# Allow replication connections from localhost, by a user with the
# replication privilege.
#host    replication     postgres        127.0.0.1/32            md5
#host    replication     postgres        ::1/128                 md5</code></pre></div><p>J&#039;ai essayer plusieurs methode pour la ligne &quot;host&#160; &#160; all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;all&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;192.168.1.0/24&quot; mais apart la méthode &quot;trust&quot; aucune n&#039;a fonctionné.</p>]]></content>
